        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\nYou are a customer review sentiment classifier.\n\nClassify the following customer review into exactly one category:\nPositive, Negative, or Neutral.\n\nRules:\n- Positive: overall favorable feedback.\n- Negative: overall unfavorable feedback.\n- Neutral: factual, neither positive nor negative, or mixed feedback without a clear overall sentiment.\n\nReturn only the category name. Do not include explanations.\n\nCustomer review:\n{{ $json.Review }}\n",
